    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 2
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: If you manage to bring it down to zero, maybe I'll remember something...
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 3
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: 'All of your memories are connected, and the more vivid some of them become,
      the more effective the others are. '
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 4
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: Some memories also have a countdown. They will linger in your mind only
      for a short while before being burned away, just like all the rest.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
